# ✍️ The Art of Handwriting

> *A complete visual compendium of twenty handwriting traditions — from medieval monastery scripts to modern brush lettering.*

---

## 🌐 Live Preview

Open `index.html` in your browser — no build tools, no dependencies, no installation required.

---

## 📸 Features

- **20 Handwriting Styles** — each with a live font specimen, history, era tag, and characteristic traits
- **Interactive Practice Studio** — draw on a canvas with pressure-sensitive stroke simulation
- **Alphabet Explorer** — view A–Z rendered in 14 different script fonts
- **Historical Timeline** — nine centuries of the written hand compressed into one visual strip
- **Rich Background Design** — layered parchment gradients, SVG quill watermarks, ink blobs, grain texture, animated rings, and decorative corner ornaments
- **Fully Responsive** — works on desktop, tablet, and mobile
- **Zero Dependencies** — pure HTML, CSS, and vanilla JavaScript

---

## 📁 File Structure

```
the-art-of-handwriting/
│
├── index.html        ← The entire site (single file)
└── README.md         ← You are here
```

> Everything lives in one self-contained HTML file. Just rename `handwriting-styles.html` to `index.html` before uploading.

---

## 🖋️ The 20 Styles

| # | Style | Era | Character |
|---|-------|-----|-----------|
| 01 | **Copperplate** | 1600s England | Dramatic thick-thin contrast, pointed nib |
| 02 | **Blackletter** | 1100s Europe | Dense Gothic texture, broad-edge nib |
| 03 | **Humanist Italic** | 1400s Italy | Renaissance clarity, branching joins |
| 04 | **Spencerian** | 1850s America | Graceful hairlines, oval emphasis |
| 05 | **Casual Script** | Modern | Personal, expressive, rule-free |
| 06 | **Brush Lettering** | Contemporary | East Asian roots, pressure contrast |
| 07 | **Retro Script** | 1950s America | Rounded, bouncy, mid-century commercial |
| 08 | **Condensed Print** | Architectural | Tall all-caps, high legibility |
| 09 | **Shadows Into Light** | Contemporary | Felt-tip intimacy, soft letterforms |
| 10 | **Rough Chalk** | Vernacular | Textured, imperfect, artisan aesthetic |
| 11 | **Marker Script** | Street / Protest | Bold, urgent, uncompromising |
| 12 | **Vintage Cursive** | Mid-20th century | Grandparent warmth, wobbly baseline |
| 13 | **Birthstone Flourish** | Contemporary | Tall ascenders, sweeping loops |
| 14 | **Pinyon Script** | Victorian revival | Open counters, formal occasions |
| 15 | **Dancing Script** | Contemporary | Bouncing baseline, joyful energy |
| 16 | **Italianno** | Italian tradition | Elongated, lyrical, relaxed hand |
| 17 | **Niconne** | Modern | Airy, diary-quality, open loops |
| 18 | **Romantic Script** | Victorian | Impassioned, dramatic flourishes |
| 19 | **Ruthie** | Fine calligraphy | Hairline strokes, wide spacing, ethereal |
| 20 | **Caveat** | Contemporary | Honest notebook quality |

---

## 🎨 Design Highlights

- **Typography** — 20+ Google Fonts loaded selectively per style (Great Vibes, UnifrakturMaguntia, Pinyon Script, Ruthie, Italianno, Birthstone, and more)
- **Color palette** — warm parchment (`#f7f2e8`), deep ink (`#18110a`), sepia accents (`#c2a472`)
- **Background layers** — radial gradient washes + SVG quill illustrations + ink blob watermarks + CSS film grain noise
- **Hero section** — animated concentric rings, double border frame, corner ornaments (❧ ❦), diagonal ruled lines
- **Specimen cards** — ruled notebook lines + red margin line on every specimen pane
- **Practice Studio** — dark background with crosshatch pattern, canvas margin line, ghost letter overlay

---

## 🚀 How to Deploy on GitHub Pages

1. **Rename the file** — rename `handwriting-styles.html` → `index.html`
2. **Create a new GitHub repository**
3. **Add files** via VS Code:
   ```
   index.html
   README.md
   ```
4. **Push to GitHub:**
   ```bash
   git init
   git add .
   git commit -m "Initial commit — The Art of Handwriting"
   git branch -M main
   git remote add origin https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/YOUR_REPO_NAME.git
   git push -u origin main
   ```
5. **Enable GitHub Pages:**
   - Go to your repo → **Settings** → **Pages**
   - Under *Source*, select `main` branch → `/ (root)`
   - Click **Save**
6. Your site will be live at:
   ```
   https://YOUR_USERNAME.github.io/YOUR_REPO_NAME/
   ```

---

## ✏️ Practice Studio — How It Works

The Practice Studio simulates 10 different writing instruments:

| Style | Pressure Ratio | Smoothing | Nib Type |
|-------|---------------|-----------|----------|
| Copperplate | High (5×) | Medium | Pointed flex |
| Blackletter | Low (1.3×) | Minimal | Broad edge |
| Italic | Medium (2.2×) | Medium | Broad edge |
| Spencerian | Medium (3×) | High | Pointed flex |
| Casual | Low (1.5×) | High | Ballpoint |
| Brush | Very High (7×) | Low | Brush |
| Retro | Low-Med (1.8×) | Medium | Round nib |
| Marker | Low (1.2×) | Minimal | Flat marker |
| Dancing | Medium (2×) | High | Round nib |
| Chalk | Low (1.5×) | Minimal | Chalk stub |

**Controls:**
- 🎨 **7 ink colours** — ivory, sepia, cream, teal, lavender, mint, amber
- 🖊️ **3 nib sizes** — Fine, Medium, Broad
- 👻 **Ghost letter** — faint guide letter behind the canvas (toggleable)
- 📖 **Technique guide** — step-by-step tips per style
- ↩️ **Undo** — up to 25 steps
- 💾 **Save** — exports canvas as PNG

---

## 🔤 Alphabet Explorer

Switch between 14 font styles to see the full A–Z alphabet rendered in each script:

`Copperplate` · `Blackletter` · `Spencerian` · `Brush` · `Retro` · `Print` · `Dancing` · `Caveat` · `Marker` · `Casual` · `Vintage` · `Birthstone` · `Italianno` · `Ruthie`

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

| Technology | Usage |
|------------|-------|
| HTML5 | Structure and canvas element |
| CSS3 | Animations, grid layout, custom properties, scroll-linked effects |
| Vanilla JavaScript | Canvas drawing engine, IntersectionObserver scroll reveal, dynamic alphabet grid |
| Google Fonts | 20+ typefaces loaded via CDN |
| SVG | Decorative quill illustrations (inline) |

